      "title": "Empirical methods intro",
      "gist": "Recording hundreds of cortical neurons in culture with multielectrode arrays, the authors built effective networks via transfer entropy, decomposed thousands of three-neuron triads, and found synergy strongly tracks feedforward information propagation."
    },
