      "title": "5.1. Synergy in Rich Clubs",
      "gist": "Rich clubs, the densely interconnected core neurons that carry most information traffic, show roughly 2.7 times more synergy per triad and account for about 88% of network-wide synergistic computation despite containing fewer neurons.",
