      "title": "5.2. The Importance of Feedforward, Feedback, and Recurrent Connections",
      "gist": "Triads with more recurrent connections between source neurons show greater synergy, feedback connections correlate with slightly less synergy, and feedforward strength remains the strongest predictor, explaining why rich-club triads are synergy-dense.",
      "sourceHeading": "5.2. The Importance of Feedforward, Feedback, and Recurrent Connections"
    },
