      "title": "5.3. Synergy from the Convergence of Correlated Information",
      "gist": "Synergy rises with the similarity of converging source-neuron activity at short, synaptic timescales but peaks and then falls at longer timescales, as growing similarity instead becomes redundant rather than synergistic information.",
