      "title": "5.4. Caveats to Consider",
      "gist": "These findings rest on bivariate transfer-entropy networks, which can overestimate connection significance, and on cultured cortical tissue rather than living brains, leaving open whether behaving animals would show the same patterns.",
      "sourceHeading": "5.4. Caveats to Consider"
