      "title": "5.5. PID in Behaving Primates",
      "gist": "In macaques performing a multi-phase task, synergy again rose in high-degree, well-clustered neurons, but shifted toward redundancy during movement execution, suggesting the brain duplicates signals for reliable transmission to distant muscles.",
      "sourceHeading": "5.5. PID in Behaving Primates"
