        "spya-kmgwhs",
        "spya-tz99zn"
      ],
      "title": "Data type and sample size",
      "gist": "Choosing a redundancy measure depends on whether data are discrete or continuous, and any multivariate analysis needs enough data to reliably estimate joint probabilities, since undersampling severely distorts entropy and information estimates."
    },
