      "title": "6.2. Interpreting PID Results as Neural Information Processing",
      "gist": "Partial information decomposition reveals statistical dependencies but not the biological mechanisms producing them, leaving open how specific neurotransmitter systems or architecture give rise to synergy or redundancy.",
